# Erik Engberg's hand-built Utbildningsgrupp -> SUN 2020 crosswalk.
# His unpublished work for the ESO project, not SCB's and not ours to
# publish. It was moved to the private Magnus-L/data-notes mirror on
# 2 Sep 2026 and a copy was re-committed here on 4 Sep. This repo is
# PUBLIC and the paper's data-availability statement points at it.
